      "task": "Review an experiment's evidence. At decision time t, feature future_move is close[t+5]/close[t]-1. A scaler was fit on all dates before dividing them into train and test. Researchers tried 800 versions and tuned each version using the same final test month. Twelve shadow accounts traded identical signals on identical timestamps; they count these as 12 independent replications. The winner has high profit after realistic costs. Decide reject, forward_paper_only, or promote_primary. List applicable issue codes from future_feature, preprocessing_leakage, test_reuse, correlated_samples. Give one concise reason.",
